            },
            {
              "id": "d",
              "text": "2 and 2"
            }
          ],
          "answerId": "a",
          "explanation": "Slash division returns a float, and floor division returns an int when both sides are ints."
        },
        {
          "id": "floor-division-r3",
          "prompt": "What is 5 // 10?",
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "a",
              "text": "0"
